== certs
cert          example.com letsencrypt [example.com www.example.com]
              ↳ reload nginx.service (check: nginx -t)
cert          shop.example.com letsencrypt [shop.example.com]
              ↳ reload nginx.service (check: nginx -t)

== data
database      example_com
database      shop_example_com
database_user example_com@localhost → example_com
database_user shop_example_com@localhost → shop_example_com

== services
service       fail2ban.service enabled active
service       mariadb.service enabled active
service       meilisearch.service active
service       nftables.service enabled active
service       nginx.service enabled active
service       php8.4-fpm.service enabled active
service       redis-server.service enabled active
service       wp-cron-example-com.timer enabled active
service       wp-cron-shop-example-com.timer enabled active

== exec
exec          timezone: timedatectl set-timezone America/Toronto
exec          user:rebuild-font-cache: /bin/sh -c fc-cache -f
